    "title": "Food options abound along Open Streets route - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dean Jackson ,\n10 hours ago It’s called Open Streets, but you might stumble into some tasty treats if you aren’t careful during the city of Fort Wayne event. Open Streets returns Sunday, Aug. 16, from noon-4 p.m. along South Calhoun Street between The Landing and Pontiac Street. The city shuts the corridor down for walking, biking, ambling, skipping, or however you self-propel. Read full article",
